------------------------------------------------------------------------
Acknowledgements
------------------------------------------------------------------------

SplatFPV (https://github.com/Rouf0x/splatfpv, MIT) showed that browser FPV
flight through Gaussian splats is possible. No code from it is included.

Rate curve formulas and PID scaling constants were read from Betaflight 4.5.1
(GPL-3.0) and re-implemented; no Betaflight code is copied into this
repository. Reference values in packages/sim-core/test/vectors/ were produced
by compiling the Betaflight functions in a harness kept outside this
repository; only the resulting numbers are included. See docs/PROVENANCE.md.

